Third-party code
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project vendors a modified subset of Graphify at vendor/graphify-br/.

  Upstream:   https://github.com/safishamsi/graphify
  Commit:     0738af373af9cf5c95f862cc5f3327fd96b4ea23
              (also recorded in vendor/GRAPHIFY_COMMIT.txt and
              vendor/graphify-br/VENDORED.md)
  License:    Apache License, Version 2.0 — see vendor/graphify-br/LICENSE.
              Older portions were contributed under the MIT License prior to
              upstream's relicensing and remain available under those terms;
              that text is retained in vendor/graphify-br/LICENSE-MIT.
  Attribution and the upstream NOTICE required by Apache-2.0 §4(d) are carried
  in vendor/graphify-br/NOTICE.

Modifications by the BlastRadius authors, per ROADMAP §10.1 and §29.4:
the LLM semantic-extraction pass and every cloud backend are removed, as are
the non-code extractors, the Obsidian/wiki/SVG/GraphML/Cypher exporters, the
Neo4j/FalkorDB push sinks, the PostgreSQL introspector, the MCP-config
ingester, the URL ingester, query logging and the work-memory/reflect layer.
Extraction is the deterministic tree-sitter AST path only, so every graph in
the dataset is exactly reproducible from source.
